          "id": "4f4c9005-8d97-473d-8540-a63fb3c4bc7c",
          "memory": "Devon had a long day at work on September 22, 2026 because his team would not stop talking in a meeting where they decided on a team lunch at 2 p.m. on Saturday, September 26, 2026 at Domino's near the office. About 5-6 coworkers planned to go, but Devon refused to attend despite his boss saying it would be good for morale.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "133d748c-9bca-4a4a-bf4f-4dee02f04444",
          "memory": "Devon planned to help his mom with groceries on the afternoon of Saturday, September 26, 2026 instead of attending his work team lunch at Domino's. User asked Devon to tell his mom hi.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "4bf2e586-ec93-4c87-8c1b-2164fdcf6518",
          "memory": "User demolished the potato salad at Sunday lunch on September 20, 2026 at Devon's mom's house, which Devon's mom still talked about on September 22, 2026, with User saying it was so good.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ddaea90a-d896-4fa2-a41b-86643801d908",
          "memory": "Devon received leftover potato salad from his mom after the September 20, 2026 Sunday lunch and had already finished all the leftovers by the evening of September 22, 2026, joking he has zero self-control.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "a6c6bd9b-6c23-4f47-90ee-ca87a130ab20",
          "memory": "As of the evening of September 22, 2026, Devon still had not set up autopay for his electric bill after forgetting again, despite planning to do it September 17. User reminded him and Devon said he would do it on his laptop in a sec.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e7b886d2-c20b-43dd-b62d-2d4287cedfce",
          "memory": "On the evening of September 22, 2026, User cooked lemon pepper chicken in the oven for dinner while stuck waiting, and Devon planned a lazy dinner of cereal after his long meeting.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "fd2b2b42-4c55-44fa-bacc-7ff3704cb4b6",
          "memory": "Traffic on 5th Street was still messed up by construction with the road by the bank blocked off as of September 22, 2026. User needed to go that way on Thursday, September 24, 2026, and Devon advised leaving early.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bda2939e-6d68-490d-a9cb-2db68a6c707b",
          "memory": "User and Devon agreed Luigi's pizza is far superior to Domino's with no comparison after Luigi's, saying Luigi's garlic knots ruined other pizza for them during their September 22, 2026 chat.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
